  "description": "This 3D Ship model is a detailed, game-ready asset created for a wide range of digital projects. It combines realistic design, optimized geometry, and high-quality PBR textures, making it perfect for games, animations, VR/AR experiences, or cinematic scenes. The model has clean topology, balanced polycount, and comes in common formats such as FBX, OBJ, and BLEND for easy integration. Textures include albedo, roughness, metallic, and normal maps to ensure realistic lighting and material definition. The ship’s structure is carefully modeled to capture authentic proportions and details, from the hull to the deck, making it versatile for both close-up renders and large-scale scenes. Its performance-friendly design makes it suitable for real-time engines, while still keeping a high level of realism. Whether used as a central asset in a game level, a background element in a cinematic, or part of a VR/AR simulation, this ship adapts to different workflows.",
